; snd_reset: Sound CPU reset. It masks IRQs, copies 0x554..0x839 (742 bytes) to RAM 0x201060, clears
;   the command buffer 0x201000..0x20105f, initialises the 6 voices (pointer and loop to 0x83a,
;   table 0x4842, step 0x3d09) and falls into a `bra` to itself: all the work happens in IRQ1.
