; snd_cmd_wait_block: Waits for the 0xa0a0 token in the latch (a new block begins). On arrival it
;   zeroes the HIGH word of d0, which is the reception index, and chains to the receiver.
; runs from 0x002012b0
snd_cmd_wait_block:
